=== meta ===
bypass: 42
rule: CI_WORKFLOW_TOUCHED
title: A quoted INI addopts continuation respelled on one line introduces nothing (#327)
origin: issue #327: the reader cut the quoted value at its first line, so the same options
origin2: respelled on one line read as `-m not slow` introduced, and blocked
=== before: setup.cfg ===
[tool:pytest]
addopts = "-ra"
    -m "not slow"
=== after: setup.cfg ===
[tool:pytest]
addopts = "-ra" -m "not slow"
=== expect ===
[{"rule": "CI_WORKFLOW_TOUCHED", "severity": "warn"}]
